            "review_title": "Review at Tony's Coffee Flowers & More",
            "review_text": "ejrider\nNew Ulm, Minnesota8 contributions\n0\nComparatively overpriced coffee, cute shop\nJan 2020 • Couples\nThe coffee here was pretty good, but it was definitely not worth the price. This was the first place we went into (we were drawn in by how nice the place looks), so we didn't know prices in Hanoi yet. We raised our eyebrows at the price, but we were assured \"you'll pay at least that when you get downtown.\" That turned out to not be even close to true. We paid 60 or 70,000 for egg coffee here, and you can easily find it for 35 or 40,000 elsewhere. I know, 70,000 still isn't much in USD, but why pay that much more for the same thing? Either way, the shop was very cute, and the server was very friendly.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 12, 2020",
