            "review_title": "Review at Tony's Coffee Flowers & More",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n1\nBeautiful Inside and Beautiful Outside\nJun 2019 • Friends\nSince Hanoi has more coffee shops that I'd every thought imaginable, it was nice to see that this place tries to differentiate itself. Here, on the ground floor, you can buy fresh flowers as well as coffee and fruit smoothies.The cool thing is that, even if you don't elect to buy flowers, the whole ground floor smells like you're inside a rose!! Its really very lovely. We had delicious smoothies upstairs. There are outdoor seats as well but it was hot so we stayed inside. Still, we had a nice view of West Lake which is just across the street.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 15, 2019",
